      "bookTitle": "The Assertiveness Workbook",
      "author": "Randy J. Paterson",
      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Fogging Defuses Hostility",
      "body": "When someone hurls criticism at you, fighting back gives them fuel. Fogging means agreeing with the small kernel of truth or agreeing in principle, while absorbing the impact like thick fog that absorbs a rock.",
