      "author": "Randy J. Paterson",
      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Distinguish Assertiveness From Aggression",
      "body": "People often stay silent because they fear becoming a bully. Aggression aims to dominate, humiliate, and crush opposition. Assertiveness aims for clarity, dignity, and honest connection.",
