      "bookId": "the-assertiveness-workbook",
      "bookTitle": "The Assertiveness Workbook",
      "author": "Randy J. Paterson",
      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "actionable",
      "headline": "Separate Facts From Interpretations",
      "body": "When conflict hits, stick to observable camera-footage facts. Instead of 'You deliberately ignored me,' state 'I sent two emails on Tuesday that did not get a reply.' Facts invite conversation; mind-reading invites war.",
