      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "mental-model",
      "headline": "The Discomfort Vaccine",
      "body": "Setting boundaries feels scary at first. Think of awkwardness as a vaccine: taking a tiny dose of social discomfort right now immunizes you against months of resentment and burnout down the road.",
